* ''Bromelia laevis'' <small>Schult. & Schult.f. [non-valide]</small>
* ''Bromelia pallida'' <small>Ker Gawl.</small>
* ''Pitcairnia discolor'' <small>Loisel.</small>
* ''Pourretia magnispatha'' <small>Colla</small>
